                            "expected": 1752000000000.0
                        },
                        {
                            "variable": "chain_length",
                            "time": 0.0,
                            "expected": 6.574675324675325
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "upstream_high_nox_short_chain_low_nox",
                    "description": "Low-NOx endpoint of the upstream `COOxidation: High NOx - Short Chain Length` test (test_co_oxidation.jl:272-303). Inputs CO=2.5e18, OH=5.0e11, HO₂=5.0e13, NO=2.5e15, NO₂=2.5e16, O₃=1e18 m⁻³ — the radical pool halved from the default. Pins all six outputs at rel=1e-10. Pairs with `upstream_high_nox_short_chain_high_nox` to reproduce the upstream cross-test assertion L_HOx(high NOx) > L_HOx(low NOx): this endpoint pins L_HOx=1.395e11, the high-NOx endpoint pins L_HOx=3.7645e12, so the inequality holds structurally. chain_length=7.258 > 0 satisfies the upstream positivity assertion.",
